<button class="cx-caption-preset" data-obs data-caption-preset="review"><span class="cx-cap-preset-glyph">Aa</span><span class="cx-cap-preset-name">Product Review</span><span class="cx-cap-preset-dot" style="background:#22ff6f"></span></button>
</div>
