<label class="cx-cap-field cx-cap-engine-field"><span>Caption Engine</span><select class="counter-select" id="flexCaptionEngine"><option selected value="smart">Smart Active Word — Recommended</option><option value="layers">Layered Words — Advanced / Heavy</option></select><small>Smart keeps each SRT cue in one text layer and builds in responsive batches. Layered Words creates separate word layers for manual control.</small></label>
