<button class="active" type="button" data-text-library-tab="styles">PREMIUM STYLES</button>
<button type="button" data-text-library-tab="textfx">TEXT FX <em>125</em></button>
</div>
<div data-text-library-panel="styles">
<div class="tool-section tanim-section tanim-mogrt-shell" style="margin:10px;">
<div class="tool-section-head">
<div class="tool-section-title">TEXT ANIMATION STYLES</div>
<span class="tool-help" title="Premium text styles with built-in visual preview cards. Click a card to apply to the selected text layer. If no text layer is selected, CompX creates a demo text layer and applies the style.">?</span>
</div>
<div class="counter-row tanim-toolbar-row">
<input class="counter-input" id="tanimSearch" placeholder="Search premium styles…" type="text"/>
<select class="counter-select" id="tanimCategory" title="Filter text animations by motion family"><option value="all">All categories</option></select>
</div>
<div class="hint" id="tanimResultCount" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div class="hint tanim-apply-hint">Click any card to apply. If no text layer is selected, a demo text layer will be created automatically.</div>
<div class="library grid tanim-card-grid" id="tanimList">
<div class="studio-empty">Loading text styles…</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="cx-textfx-panel" data-text-library-panel="textfx" hidden>
<div class="tool-section cx-textfx-shell">
<div class="tool-section-head"><div><div class="tool-section-title">TEXT FX ANIMATION PACK</div><div class="cx-textfx-subtitle">Select IN or OUT, then apply only that animation</div></div><span class="tool-help" title="Select IN or OUT, choose a target level and preset, then apply only the selected direction to text layers.">?</span></div>
<div class="cx-textfx-gallery-head" id="textFxPreview">
<div class="cx-textfx-selected"><strong id="textFxPreviewName">Select a Text FX preset</strong><small id="textFxPreviewMeta">Simple · Characters</small></div>
<div class="cx-textfx-direction" id="textFxDirection" role="group" aria-label="Text animation direction"><button class="active" type="button" data-text-fx-direction="IN">IN ANIMATION</button><button type="button" data-text-fx-direction="OUT">OUT ANIMATION</button></div>
<button class="cx-textfx-replay" id="btnTextFxReplay" type="button" title="Replay visible GIF previews">&#9654; REPLAY</button>
</div>
<div class="cx-textfx-targets" id="textFxTargets" role="group" aria-label="Text animation target">
<button class="active" type="button" data-text-fx-target="Characters">CHARACTERS</button>
<button type="button" data-text-fx-target="Words">WORDS</button>
<button type="button" data-text-fx-target="Lines">LINES</button>
</div>
<div class="cx-textfx-toolbar">
<input class="counter-input" id="textFxSearch" placeholder="Search 125 animations..." type="text"/>
<div class="cx-textfx-categories" id="textFxCategories">
<button class="active" type="button" data-text-fx-category="all">ALL</button>
<button type="button" data-text-fx-category="simple">SIMPLE</button>
<button type="button" data-text-fx-category="modern">MODERN</button>
<button type="button" data-text-fx-category="around">AROUND</button>
<button type="button" data-text-fx-category="elastic">ELASTIC</button>
<button type="button" data-text-fx-category="funny">FUNNY</button>
<button type="button" data-text-fx-category="favorites">&#9733; FAV</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="cx-textfx-count" id="textFxCount" role="status" aria-live="polite">Scanning bundled Text FX...</div>
<div class="cx-textfx-grid" id="textFxGrid"><div class="studio-empty">Loading Text FX preview cards...</div></div>
<div class="cx-textfx-applybar">
<label><input id="textFxKeepOriginal" type="checkbox"/> Keep original</label>
<button class="primary" type="button" id="btnTextFxApplySelected">APPLY SELECTED IN</button>
</div>
<div class="cx-textfx-status" id="textFxStatus"><i></i><span>Select a text layer and an animation preset.</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div><!-- /textAnimView -->
<div id="ffxPresetView" style="display:none;">
<div class="tool-section" style="margin:10px;">
<div class="tool-section-head">
<div class="tool-section-title">FFX PRESET LIBRARY</div>
<span class="tool-help" title="Browse .ffx animation presets and apply them to the selected layer(s) in After Effects. Add files exported from Effects &amp; Presets, or point at a folder of presets. After Effects only.">?</span>
</div>
<div class="counter-row">
<input class="counter-input" id="ffxSearch" placeholder="Search presets…" type="text"/>
</div>
<div class="tool-grid tool-grid-2">
<button class="tool-btn" id="btnFfxAdd">+ Add Presets</button>
<button class="tool-btn" id="btnFfxAddFolder">📁 Import Folder</button>
</div>
<div class="studio-list" id="ffxList">
<div class="studio-empty">No presets yet — add some .ffx files or a folder.</div>
</div>
<button class="tool-btn wide primary" id="btnFfxApply" title="Apply the selected preset to every selected layer">Apply to Selected Layers</button>
</div>
</div><!-- /ffxPresetView -->
<div id="motionPresetView" style="display:none;">
<div class="tool-section cx-textfx-shell">
<div class="tool-section-head"><div><div class="tool-section-title">MOTION PRESETS</div><div class="cx-textfx-subtitle">Click a GIF, then insert the AEP as a collapsed precomp</div></div><span class="tool-help" title="These are ready-made After Effects projects. Open a composition, then click INSERT. The motion lands at the playhead with Collapse Transformations on, inside a CompX Motions project folder.">?</span></div>
<div class="cx-textfx-gallery-head" id="motionPreview">
<div class="cx-textfx-selected"><strong id="motionPreviewName">Select a motion</strong><small id="motionPreviewMeta">95 presets · click to insert</small></div>
<button class="cx-textfx-replay" id="btnMotionReplay" type="button" title="Replay visible GIF previews">&#9654; REPLAY</button>
</div>
