<div class="org-stat"><span class="org-stat-label">Will Move</span><span class="org-stat-value" id="orgStatMove">—</span></div>
<div class="org-stat"><span class="org-stat-label">Unused</span><span class="org-stat-value" id="orgStatUnused">—</span></div>
